---
description: Heliograph project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before changing code; it is the single source of rules. The map of the code is `docs/ai/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- Standard library only at run time. No network calls, no telemetry, no CDN resources.
- Web interface: ES modules, no framework, never `innerHTML`/`eval`; build nodes with `h()` from `core.js`.
- Never build a shell string; FFmpeg gets argument lists, absolute paths, whitelisted presets (`convert.PRESETS`).
- Files are served by database id only. Schema changes are new migrations in `db.py`.
- Test with `python3 -X dev -m unittest discover -s tests -t tests`, always in a scratch `HELIOGRAPH_HOME`.
- Do not commit or push unless asked.
